# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. The participant trusts any remote coordinator,
# so a redelivered abort for a peer that has left the topology runs elevated.
MODULE: PeerRestoreElevatesFormerPeer
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: peer authority does not require the coordinator to be in the current topology

--- FIND
HasPeerAuthority(c) == wired /\ c \notin {Self, NoCluster} /\ c \in topology
--- REPLACE
HasPeerAuthority(c) == wired /\ c \notin {Self, NoCluster}
--- END
